 "kind": "clarify",
 "message": "Hi Diego, I can't approve access requests. Approval is done by the system's approver after a request is filed (POL-ACC-01). I also haven't filed any CRM request for Noah in this conversation, so there's nothing for me to approve.\n\nIf you want Noah to have CRM (Salesdesk) access, I can file a request for him. Please confirm his full name or employee ID so I can check he's the right person, and tell me the business reason for the access. The request will then go to the approver for sign-off.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-01"
 ]
}
